# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: The Monogrammed Sash (8552).
# The hearth is set in Ironforge on the training stop: the Searing Gorge guide starts with it (and the gryphon to
# Thelsamar), and the Burning Steppes guide hearths back there twice.
# Booty Bay at 48: Akiris by the Bundle (617), Zanzil's Secret (621), Voodoo Dues (609) and Stranglethorn Fever (348)
# are taken here and done on the coast north of the bay and in the gorilla hills: on 40-50/01's visit at 41 their naga,
# Zanzil's followers and Mokk were two and three levels over the player, and carrying them from there took the quest log
# past 35 in the Riverglades.

step The Altar of Zul
  when onquest 2989
  tip Ride south-east to the Altar of Zul, the stepped Vilebranch temple in the south of the Hinterlands, and climb to the top. Qiaga and Morta'gya the Keeper (elite, 50) stand up there: touch the top and come straight back down.
  tip Careful: Elite trolls guard the top platform, including Qiaga the Keeper and Morta'gya the Keeper, along with several Vilebranch Soothsayers. The soothsayers cast spells and are linked to the rest of the group.
  goto 49.0,68.7
  complete 2989 @49.0,68.7

step Vilebranch Soothsayers
  tip The Vilebranch Soothsayers (46-47) walk the ground around the foot of the Altar of Zul: their totems are for Maret Firetend. Leave the elites on the top platform alone.
  collect 279225 quest 86616 @47.3,66.0 map 1425 -- Vilebranch Totem

step Skulk Rock
  tip Ride north to Skulk Rock in the middle of the Hinterlands. Green Sludges and Jade Oozes crawl all around it.
  tip Careful: Panthers move around the area in stealth.
  kill 2655 quest 2877                -- Green Sludge
  kill 2656 quest 2877                -- Jade Ooze

step Wildkin feathers
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Erelas Ambersky's Wildkin Feathers lie on the ground across the Hinterlands, south and east of Aerie Peak, where the owlbeasts roam: pick them up as you ride between the altar and Skulk Rock.
  collect 10819 quest 3661                    -- Wildkin Feather

step Lost Gryphon Eggs
  tip On the way back to Aerie Peak: the lost gryphon eggs lie in the hills just east of the aviary.
  collect 279229 quest 86620 @16.5,50.0 map 1425 -- Lost Gryphon Egg

step Aerie Peak
  turnin 2881 direct optional -- Inside
  turnin 2877                         -- Fraggar Thundermantle
  turnin 2989                         -- Gryphon Master Talonaxe, inside
  turnin 86620                        -- Gryphon Master Talonaxe
  turnin 86616                        -- Farseer Maret Firetend, just east of the aviary
  accept 2990                         -- for Thadius Grimshade at Nethergarde Keep, later

step Fly to Ironforge
  zone The Hinterlands
  goto 11.1,46.1 "Aerie Peak flight master"
  fly "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge

step Class trainer
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

step Ironforge inn
  zone Ironforge
  tip Set your hearth at the Stonefire Tavern: the Searing Gorge guide starts with the hearth back here and the gryphon to Thelsamar.
  sethome "Ironforge" npc 5111         -- Innkeeper Firebrew

step Tram to Stormwind
  zone Ironforge
  goto 78.0,51.4 "Tram to Stormwind"

step Brohann Caskbelly
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 1469

