# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Blasted Lands

step The bloodmages
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip The bloodmages' camp is the first stop beside the road into the Blasted Lands, north-west of Nethergarde Keep.
  accept 2581                         -- Bloodmage Drazial: keep the five, their beasts (48-53) wait for the level-52 Blasted Lands stop
  accept 2583
  accept 2585
  accept 2601                         -- Bloodmage Lynnore
  accept 2603

step Nethergarde Keep
  tip Ride on east along the road to the keep first: the Crate of Power Stones expires an hour after Darkshire.
  turnin 2990                         -- Thadius Grimshade, at the top of the keep
  note Thadius' next task, Nekrum's Medallion, is a Zul'Farrak quest: skip it.
  turnin 1364                         -- Watcher Mahar Ba, upstairs
  getfp "Nethergarde Keep" npc 8609   -- Alexandra Constantine
  turnin 1395                         -- Quartermaster Lungertz
  turnin 1425

