step Wild Shore: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The charts and orders lie in the pirate camp on the Wild Shore, just south of Booty Bay; its Swashbucklers walk the shore. The Warlocks and Swashbucklers (41-43) are under you now.
  collect 3920 quest 604              -- Bloodsail Charts
  collect 3921 quest 604              -- Bloodsail Orders
  kill 1563 quest 604                 -- Bloodsail Swashbuckler

step Booty Bay
  turnin 604                          -- Fleet Master Seahorn, top floor
  accept 608

step The Bloodsail captains
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The three Bloodsail ships lie at anchor off the coast just south of Booty Bay: Captain Stillwater (45) and Captain Keelhaul (46) on the nearer decks, Fleet Master Firallon (48) on the flagship, each with a crew of 42-45 pirates. Swim out, clear each deck from the edge and pull one at a time.
  kill 2550 quest 608.1 @32.9,88.2 map 1434 -- Captain Stillwater
  kill 2548 quest 608.2 @29.3,88.3 map 1434 -- Captain Keelhaul
  kill 2546 quest 608.3 @30.6,90.6 map 1434 -- Fleet Master Firallon

step Booty Bay
  turnin 608                          -- Fleet Master Seahorn, top floor

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stranglethorn's coast, at 48

step Naga Explorers
  tip Leave town by the tunnel and ride north along the coast past the Bloodsail camp: the naga comb the beaches beyond it and drop the reeds.
  collect 4029 quest 617              -- Akiris Reed

step Zanzil's village
  tip Ride on north along the coast to Zanzil's village. Every Zanzil follower can drop the mixture; Chucky "Ten Thumbs" walks the south of the camp.
  collect 4016 quest 621              -- Zanzil's Mixture
  collect 3926 quest 609              -- Chucky's Huge Ring
  collect 3925 quest 609              -- Jon-Jon's Golden Spyglass

step Maury and Jon-Jon
  tip Maury "Club Foot" Wilkins and Jon-Jon the Crow stand together in the hills just north of Zanzil's village.
  collect 3924 quest 609              -- Maury's Clubbed Foot

step Gorilla hills
  tip Ride back south-east to the Mistvale gorilla hills above Booty Bay. Witch Doctor Unbagwa sits among the gorillas: take ten Gorilla Fangs from the Elder Mistvale Gorillas first.
  collect 2799 x10 -- Gorilla Fang

step Unbagwa's ritual
  tip Hand in the fangs and stay: three waves of gorillas come, Mokk the Savage last.
  tip Careful: three waves of gorillas come one after another with little rest between, then Mokk the Savage. Start at full health and mana, and stay near Unbagwa. Some classes find it hard alone: a friend makes it easy.
  turnin 349 direct -- Witch Doctor Unbagwa, inside Spirit Den
  collect 2797 quest 348              -- Heart of Mokk

step Booty Bay
  tip Ride back down to town.
  turnin 617                          -- Privateer Bloads
  accept 623                          -- for Privateer Groy in Theramore: keep it, the Un'Goro guide lands there
  turnin 348                          -- Fin Fizracket
  note Crank's next Zanzil errand starts in Thousand Needles: skip it.
  turnin 621                          -- Crank Fizzlebub, inside
  note MacKinley's next task sends you after elite ogres: skip it.
  turnin 609                          -- "Sea Wolf" MacKinley, on the top floor

