  when group 8552
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. The Monogrammed Sash needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 3985 x1 @23.3,72.1 map 1434
  accept 8552 item 3985

